    "body": "> Blink's form['foo'] is implemented in terms of the elements collection internally, with only the past names fallback. If the img fallback were moved out to the same place, that would align more with the spec and other engines.\n\nIt doesn't matter.  The proposal is that neither `form.elements.foo` nor `form.foo` returns `img` elements because no one uses such behavior.  https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/246 contains both cases.\n",
