    "body": "Oh, and the reason `<img>` is form-associated is because this:\r\n\r\n    <form><img name=\"foo\"></form>\r\n    <script>console.log(document.querySelector(\"form\").foo)</script>\r\n\r\nlogs the `<img>` element.",
