    "body": "Looks like that list is only used in the tests in shadow-dom/untriaged/html-elements-in-shadow-trees/html-forms\r\n\r\nSome of those tests don't care about what sort of element they're testing with, afaict (so not sure why they restrict to this list), while others are definitely trying to test listedness of elements.  There isn't a single test in there that actually tests form-associatedness via the named getter, afaict (and there probably should be).",
